{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_704b1a83e8a9226f-302\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>在《香港系列之細間始終你好》第十一集中，主持阮兆祥帶領觀眾走訪多間充滿香港情懷與故事的小店。節目首站來到觀塘的40年老字號豆漿店，接着參觀將東方漢字哲學融入香水的本地品牌，最後前往元朗探索非物質文化遺產傳統花牌的承載與革新。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_704b1a83e8a9226f-302\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>1. 觀塘街坊集體回憶：40年老字號「永興豆漿王」</p><p id=\"p-rc_704b1a83e8a9226f-303\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>陪伴觀塘街坊走過40年歲月的「永興豆漿王」，由老闆劉生與劉太堅持每天新鮮磨製。店舖主打豆腐花和豆漿，老闆堅持每日親力親為，由揀豆、浸豆、磨漿到煮豆漿每個工序都不馬虎，並特別選用加拿大黃豆，憑良心做到最好。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_704b1a83e8a9226f-304\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_704b1a83e8a9226f-304\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>回想當年夫妻二人經營走鬼檔，劉太照顧女兒，劉生管理檔口，甚至曾試過鋪紙皮睡在街頭，這段艱苦歲月成為女兒深刻的童年回憶。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_704b1a83e8a9226f-305\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>本來二人打算趁觀塘重建退休，但在停業兩年期間，街坊的念念不忘讓他們決定繼續堅守，延續這份觀塘獨有的人情味與家庭手藝。</span></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>店舖資料：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li></ul></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0be328b0-656d-44d7-bf19-9b5e2d08cbe2.png-2.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026jtXdKEKu971788429871.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0be328b0-656d-44d7-bf19-9b5e2d08cbe2.png-2.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3c796f9e-6b00-4256-81f2-01302cd697f0.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026D9TWXZAaIu1788429871.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3c796f9e-6b00-4256-81f2-01302cd697f0.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"945ce8e2-1cda-485d-9916-1b586ce7cf4f.png.jpeg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026VugyFxcFIU1788429872.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"945ce8e2-1cda-485d-9916-1b586ce7cf4f.png.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>2. 將漢字結合香水：本地品牌「念舍 LLEMS」</p><p id=\"p-rc_704b1a83e8a9226f-308\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>由平面設計師Jason與拍檔Cindy共同創立的香港獨立香水品牌「念舍 LLEMS」，完美結合了漢字的意境與調香手藝。品牌推出四款主打香水「源」、「迷」、「悟」、「豁」，靈感分別源自人生四個階段的想法。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_704b1a83e8a9226f-309\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>香水瓶設計融入東方哲學，瓶身四個被磨平的角象徵着人磨去菱角的心境。他們更遠赴法國邀請國際香水大師合作，用西方頂級香料呈現東方意境。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_704b1a83e8a9226f-309\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_704b1a83e8a9226f-309\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>店內設有茶室，讓客人試香時能坐下喝熱茶、分享人生高低起跌，傳遞生活態度與呼吸空間。</span></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>店舖資料：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li></ul></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f0bdde05-2ed6-4d67-a9f3-60c457a2b0a9.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026SK8oHY1iZm1788429873.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f0bdde05-2ed6-4d67-a9f3-60c457a2b0a9.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fc6aa329-a36b-4f19-817f-0acbd9695cde.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026aEowNuEfTt1788429873.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fc6aa329-a36b-4f19-817f-0acbd9695cde.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>3. 老字號花牌店第三代傳人接棒：元朗「李炎記花店」</p><p id=\"p-rc_704b1a83e8a9226f-313\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>最後一站，阮兆祥前往元朗舊區拜訪開業72年的「李炎記花店」。72歲的第二代傳人蘭姐由13歲起跟隨父親學習製作花牌，練得一手好書法，花牌上的字體採用父親自創的風格。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_704b1a83e8a9226f-314\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_704b1a83e8a9226f-314\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>傳統花牌製作繁複，需經畫圖、搭棚到掛上花牌，頂部必備象徵好兆頭的「孔雀頭」。由於工作環境具危險性且辛苦，行業極少新人入行，幸好最終由本身是搭棚工的第三代傳人Andy接棒。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_704b1a83e8a9226f-315\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>Andy接手後為傳統花牌帶來不少創新，包括將龍柱設計成「飛龍在天」形態並申請商標、將鎢絲燈改為LED燈、以及為酒樓中式婚宴設計室內小型花牌，致力守護並傳承香港非物質文化遺產。</span></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>店舖資料：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p id=\"p-rc_704b1a83e8a9226f-316\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>地址：元朗舊墟南門口29號</span></p></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li></ul></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"bca16a0e-24aa-43ea-9825-5f05d1af7927.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026V8vRU0Q3Nq1788429873.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"bca16a0e-24aa-43ea-9825-5f05d1af7927.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"09007021-3f62-4016-9257-5945b616f7fe.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026MJSU6ayP451788429872.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"09007021-3f62-4016-9257-5945b616f7fe.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b4534754-a15e-4dd0-b769-3325e6da0dbc.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026D6GEl0ggoU1788429872.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b4534754-a15e-4dd0-b769-3325e6da0dbc.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T06:18:23.532168+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":911,"images":8,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}